# A whole pack opening with sound, played by itself (--autoplay): the tear, the pack music gaining
# a layer each tier, the fanfare. Checks nothing breaks; listen to the previews that
# tools/music/pack_sounds.py writes to assets/sounds/_preview/. "flags --music" to hear it live.
from rich
flags --autoplay
view full
tab boxes
click "mythic"               # the dev row: opens a box that's sure to be this rarity
wait 3
shot climbing
wait ritual
shot result
click "lovely!"
click "common"
wait ritual
click "lovely!"
tab settings
expect text "music"
expect fits
shot settings
